# Internal hosts lea may reach although they resolve to private addresses.
# Format: <host name or IPv4 literal> <comma-separated ports>, one per line.
# Point LEA_INTERNAL_HOSTS at your own file in the user config. Examples:
#   git.example.internal      443
#   10.0.0.10                 443
# A name grants that name only: TLS to it passes when its SNI is that name, so other vhosts of the
# same ingress stay closed. An IPv4 literal grants the address, every vhost on it included.
# git SSH endpoints (LEA_GIT_SSH) are reached through the proxy's SSH forwarders, not listed here.
